        "text": "According to Marty J. Jackley, on behalf of South Dakota (Petitioner), according to Marty J. Jackley, on behalf of South Dakota (Petitioner), south Dakota argues that the Quill decision causes the state to lose massive sales\u2011tax revenue needed for education, healthcare, and infrastructure."
