              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Marty J. Jackley, on behalf of South Dakota (Petitioner), according to Marty J. Jackley, on behalf of South Dakota (Petitioner), south Dakota also says that small businesses on Main Street are harmed because out\u2011of\u2011state remote sellers have a price advantage under Quill."
